; ========================================
; ●シーン1‐3‐10
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:11_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『娯楽室』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:走进娱乐室，<br>能看见可可坐在沙发上。|#0103Adv10_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1,ArmR11

[PrintTextModified Text:哈哈哈哈哈！！<br>什么啊！？太有趣了！！|#0103Adv10_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR11

[PrintTextModified Text:真的假的？详细说说嘛～<br>没事没事，我有的是时间。|#0103Adv10_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1,ArmR11

[PrintTextModified Text:……嗯，嗯，然后呢？<br>……原来是这样啊！！哈哈哈哈哈！！|#0103Adv10_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可没有注意到艾玛的到来，<br>正在和某人对话——手里拿着手机。|#0103Adv10_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（欸……！？）|#0103Adv10_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛呆立在原地，<br>注视着把手机贴在耳边说话的可可。|#0103Adv10_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1,ArmR11

[PrintTextModified Text:可可感受到视线，这才注意到艾玛。|#0103Adv10_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:啊。|#0103Adv10_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; スマホを床に落とした音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_60 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:慌乱中可可把手机掉在了地上。|#0103Adv10_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:可可，你到底在和谁说话！？<br>你的手机能和外界联系吗！？|#0103Adv10_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛急切地追问，<br>但可可却尴尬地移开了视线。|#0103Adv10_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……笨蛋。怎么可能啊。<br>要是能和外面联系，我早就叫人来救我们了。|#0103Adv10_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:也、也对……|#0103Adv10_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（咦？那刚才……是她在自言自语，<br>　幻想着和谁通话吗……？）|#0103Adv10_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从可可身上散发的气氛，令人无法继续追问下去。|#0103Adv10_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:话说，你能不能别和我说话？<br>我们不是已经决定不再一起行动了吗。|#0103Adv10_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但、但是可可，<br>如果不和别人说话的话，状态会变得很糟糕的……|#0103Adv10_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR13,ArmL10

[PrintTextModified Text:吵死了！吵死了吵死了吵死了！|#0103Adv10_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我讨厌你！<br>我只愿意和我推说话！！|#0103Adv10_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其他的都不需要！！滚开！！<br>消失！！这一切都只是噩梦！！|#0103Adv10_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可蜷缩着捂住耳朵，大声喊道。|#0103Adv10_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR13,ArmL10

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……有来电。|#0103Adv10_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明没有任何铃声。<br>可可用失焦的眼神捡起掉在地上的手机。|#0103Adv10_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR11,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～是我哦～？很精神很精神～<br>你那边怎么样？嗯，嗯，这样啊～|#0103Adv10_Coco011| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对如此令人心痛的场面，艾玛一时语塞。|#0103Adv10_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可可……<br>　已经分不清幻想和现实了啊……）|#0103Adv10_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可的背影，正在拒绝着监牢的现实。|#0103Adv10_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但是，这里不是噩梦，<br>　而是现实啊……可可）|#0103Adv10_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:——可可，<br>今天大家决定在后院野餐。|#0103Adv10_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果可以的话，希望你能来。<br>我们会等你的……|#0103Adv10_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛对着拒绝交流的可可的背影，<br>诚恳地说道。|#0103Adv10_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可没有回头。<br>她仍在继续和那个并不存在的人对话。|#0103Adv10_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

